BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:national-dog-day@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270826
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270827
SUMMARY:National Dog Day
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:National Dog Day falls on August 26 and is one of the few "nati
 onal days" with both a documented founder and a documented reason for its 
 date. Colleen Paige\, a pet lifestyle expert and animal welfare advocate\,
  founded it in 2004 and chose August 26 because it was the day her family 
 adopted her first dog from a shelter\, when she was ten. The day's stated 
 purpose is narrower than general dog appreciation: it is an adoption campa
 ign.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-dog-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-dog-day/
CATEGORIES:Dogs
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
